---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Your Name — Personal Site">
<section class="page active" id="work">
  <h1 class="sec-h1 en">Work Experience</h1><h1 class="sec-h1 zh" style="display:none">工作经历</h1>
  <div class="sec-rule"></div>

  <div class="work-item">
    <div class="work-header" style="align-items:center;">
      <img src="/images/photos/lagram_technologies_logo.jpg" alt="Lagram" style="width:66px;height:66px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:6px;flex-shrink:0;margin-right:1rem;">
      <div class="work-title-wrap">
        <div class="work-role en">Co-Founder &amp; Machine Learning Engineer<span class="work-badge en">Current</span></div><div class="work-role zh" style="display:none">联合创始人 &amp; 机器学习工程师 <span class="work-badge zh">进行中</span></div>
        <div class="work-company en">Lagram Technologies</div><div class="work-company zh" style="display:none">凌革科技</div>
      </div>
      <div class="work-period en">Oct 2025 — Present</div><div class="work-period zh" style="display:none">2025年10月 — 至今</div>
    </div>

    <div class="work-tags">
      <span class="work-tag startup en">Startup</span><span class="work-tag startup zh" style="display:none">创业</span>
      <span class="work-tag">AI / ML</span>
      <span class="work-tag en">Compliance AI</span><span class="work-tag zh" style="display:none">合规 AI</span>
    </div>

    <p class="work-desc en">
      Co-founded an AI-driven compliance automation startup for Testing, Inspection and Certification (TIC) workflows, developing systems for regulatory reasoning, report generation, and customer management. Our system combines hybrid document retrieval, regulatory knowledge graphs, and structured report generation with traceable evidence, while using a standard-agnostic architecture to support rapid adaptation across different national standards and product categories. We also developed automated customer-management workflows and supported early commercial deployment with international TIC companies including <a href="https://www.intertek.com" target="_blank" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;">Intertek</a> and <a href="https://www.dekra.com" target="_blank" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;">DEKRA</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="work-desc zh" style="display:none">
      联合创立面向测试、检验和认证（TIC）流程的人工智能合规自动化公司，开发法规推理、报告生成和客户管理系统。系统融合混合文档检索、法规知识图谱和具有可追溯证据的结构化报告生成，并采用标准无关架构以快速适配不同国家标准和产品类别。同时开发自动化客户管理流程，并支持系统在<a href="https://www.intertek.com" target="_blank" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;">Intertek</a>和<a href="https://www.dekra.com" target="_blank" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;">DEKRA</a>等国际TIC企业中的早期商业化部署。
    </p>

    <ul class="work-bullets">
      <li class="en">
        Co-founded an AI-driven compliance automation startup for Testing, Inspection and Certification (TIC) workflows, developing systems for regulatory reasoning, report generation, and customer management.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        联合创立面向测试、检验和认证（TIC）工作流程的人工智能合规自动化公司，开发法规推理、报告生成及客户管理系统。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Built machine-learning-based compliance reasoning systems combining hybrid document retrieval, regulatory knowledge graphs, and structured report generation with traceable evidence.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        构建基于机器学习的合规推理系统，融合混合文档检索、法规知识图谱和具有可追溯证据的结构化报告生成。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Designed standard-agnostic architectures that separate regulatory clauses from workflow logic, enabling rapid adaptation across different national standards and product categories.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        设计标准无关的系统架构，将法规条款与工作流程逻辑解耦，使系统能够快速适配不同国家标准和产品类别。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Developed an automated annual-fee management system to summarize customer service records, calculate annual fees, generate client quotations, and streamline email-based customer communication.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        开发自动化年度费用管理系统，用于汇总客户服务记录、计算年度费用、生成客户报价，并简化基于电子邮件的客户沟通流程。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Supported early commercial deployment with international TIC companies including Intertek and DEKRA, validating the system through real industrial compliance-reporting and customer-management workflows.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        支持系统在Intertek和DEKRA等国际TIC企业中的早期商业化部署，并通过真实工业合规报告和客户管理流程验证系统。
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>


  <div class="work-item">
    <div class="work-header" style="align-items:center;">
      <img src="/images/photos/internet_think_tank_logo.jpg" alt="Internet Think Tank, Inc." style="width:66px;height:66px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:6px;flex-shrink:0;margin-right:1rem;">
      <div class="work-title-wrap">
        <div class="work-role en">Machine Learning Engineering Intern (Research-Oriented)</div><div class="work-role zh" style="display:none">机器学习工程实习生（研究方向）</div>
        <div class="work-company en">Internet Think Tank, Inc.</div><div class="work-company zh" style="display:none">Internet Think Tank, Inc.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="work-period en">Aug 2025 — Dec 2025</div><div class="work-period zh" style="display:none">2025年8月 — 2025年12月</div>
    </div>

    <div class="work-tags">
      <span class="work-tag intern en">Internship</span><span class="work-tag intern zh" style="display:none">实习</span>
      <span class="work-tag en">Machine Learning</span><span class="work-tag zh" style="display:none">机器学习</span>
      <span class="work-tag">HDC</span>
      <span class="work-tag en">Blockchain</span><span class="work-tag zh" style="display:none">区块链</span>
    </div>

    <p class="work-desc en">
      Developed HDCoin, a proof-of-useful-work blockchain framework that transforms conventional mining into useful training and verification of trustworthy biomedical Hyperdimensional Computing (HDC) models. The project combines distributed HDC model training, verification, design-space exploration, and adaptive mining mechanisms across multiple biomedical learning tasks.
    </p>

    <p class="work-desc zh" style="display:none">
      开发HDCoin，一种“有用工作量证明”（Proof-of-Useful-Work）区块链框架，将传统挖矿转化为可信生物医学超维计算（HDC）模型的有效训练与验证。项目结合分布式HDC模型训练、验证、设计空间探索以及自适应挖矿机制，并应用于多个生物医学学习任务。
    </p>

    <ul class="work-bullets">
      <li class="en">
        Developed HDCoin, a proof-of-useful-work blockchain framework that transforms conventional mining into useful training of trustworthy biomedical Hyperdimensional Computing (HDC) models.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        开发HDCoin，一种“有用工作量证明”区块链框架，将传统挖矿转化为可信生物医学超维计算（HDC）模型的有效训练。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Designed HDC-based mining and verification pipelines where distributed miners train, validate, reproduce, and verify biomedical learning models using nonce-generated item memories and HDC hyperparameter configurations.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        设计基于HDC的挖矿与验证流程，使分布式矿工利用由nonce生成的Item Memory和HDC超参数配置，对生物医学学习模型进行训练、验证、复现和校验。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Conducted design-space exploration across HDC dimensionality, retraining iterations, and retraining rates on four biomedical datasets, including UCIHAR, BreastMNIST, PneumoniaMNIST, and NoduleMNIST3D.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        在UCIHAR、BreastMNIST、PneumoniaMNIST和NoduleMNIST3D四个生物医学数据集上，对HDC维度、重训练迭代次数和重训练率进行了设计空间探索。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Evaluated adaptive mining difficulty and fairness mechanisms, showing how HDC configurations affect computational effort, model performance, and miners’ winning probability.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        评估自适应挖矿难度和公平性机制，分析不同HDC配置如何影响计算工作量、模型性能以及矿工的获胜概率。
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>


  <div class="work-item">
    <div class="work-header" style="align-items:center;">
      <img src="/images/photos/momentaai_logo.jpg" alt="Momenta" style="width:66px;height:66px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:6px;flex-shrink:0;margin-right:1rem;">
      <div class="work-title-wrap">
        <div class="work-role en">Project Product Manager &amp; Algorithm Engineer Intern</div><div class="work-role zh" style="display:none">项目产品经理 &amp; 算法工程师实习生</div>
        <div class="work-company en">Momenta (Autonomous Driving Company)</div><div class="work-company zh" style="display:none">Momenta（自动驾驶公司）</div>
      </div>
      <div class="work-period en">Mar 2024 — May 2024</div><div class="work-period zh" style="display:none">2024年3月 — 2024年5月</div>
    </div>

    <div class="work-tags">
      <span class="work-tag intern en">Internship</span><span class="work-tag intern zh" style="display:none">实习</span>
      <span class="work-tag en">Autonomous Driving</span><span class="work-tag zh" style="display:none">自动驾驶</span>
      <span class="work-tag en">Algorithm Engineering</span><span class="work-tag zh" style="display:none">算法工程</span>
      <span class="work-tag en">Product Management</span><span class="work-tag zh" style="display:none">产品管理</span>
    </div>

    <p class="work-desc en">
      Supported autonomous driving R&amp;D through cross-functional project coordination, rule-based obstacle avoidance and emergency decision-making algorithm development, and 3,000+ miles of real-world highway testing. Translated road-test observations and customer needs into actionable engineering and product requirements.
    </p>

    <p class="work-desc zh" style="display:none">
      参与自动驾驶研发项目的跨团队项目管理、基于规则的障碍物避让和紧急决策算法开发，并完成超过3000英里的真实高速公路道路测试。将道路测试问题和客户需求转化为可执行的工程及产品需求。
    </p>

    <ul class="work-bullets">
      <li class="en">
        Supported end-to-end project management for autonomous driving R&amp;D projects, coordinating algorithm, software, and testing teams while tracking milestones, development schedules, and cross-functional resources. Translated road-test issues into actionable algorithm requirements and engineering tasks to improve development, testing, and delivery efficiency.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        支持自动驾驶研发项目的端到端项目管理，协调算法、软件和测试团队，跟踪项目里程碑、开发进度和跨团队资源，并将道路测试问题转化为可执行的算法需求和工程任务，以提升开发、测试和交付效率。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Contributed to the development of rule-based obstacle avoidance and emergency decision-making algorithms for high-risk scenarios involving water barriers, traffic cones, road obstacles, and sudden vehicle cut-ins. Designed decision logic linking obstacle detection results to vehicle behavior and maneuver selection.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        参与基于规则的障碍物避让和紧急决策算法开发，覆盖积水障碍、交通锥、道路障碍物以及车辆突然切入等高风险场景，并设计从障碍物检测结果到车辆行为和机动策略选择的决策逻辑。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Participated in real-world autonomous driving tests on elevated highways in Shanghai, completing 3,000+ miles of on-road testing in real traffic conditions. Analyzed abnormal scenarios, tuned rule thresholds, and validated algorithm performance by investigating false triggers, missed responses, and unstable strategy transitions, contributing to improved emergency avoidance rules and broader scenario coverage.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        参与上海高架公路上的真实自动驾驶道路测试，在实际交通条件下完成超过3000英里的测试。分析异常场景、调整规则阈值，并通过排查误触发、漏响应和策略切换不稳定等问题验证算法性能，从而优化紧急避让规则并扩大场景覆盖范围。
      </li>

      <li class="en">
        Served as a liaison among product teams, engineering teams, and external clients, translating business and customer needs into actionable technical and product requirements while supporting solution integration and delivery.
      </li>
      <li class="zh" style="display:none">
        作为产品团队、工程团队和外部客户之间的沟通桥梁，将业务及客户需求转化为可执行的技术和产品需求，并支持解决方案集成与交付。
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</section>
</BaseLayout>
